        <h1 class="cs-page_title cs-font_50 cs-white_color">Answer Engine Optimization: Getting Cited by AI</h1>
        <ol class="breadcrumb" style="background:transparent;justify-content:center;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-size:14px;margin-top:14px;"><a href="../../">Home</a> <span style="opacity:0.5;margin:0 8px;">/</span> <a href="../">Blogs</a> <span style="opacity:0.5;margin:0 8px;">/</span> <span aria-current="page">Optimizing For AI Search Answer Engines 2026</span></ol>
